WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.472 --> 00:00:04.128
Say you want a company worth ten million
dollars by the end of the year.

2
00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:05.817
Big. Scary.

3
00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:07.540
I say: get granular.

4
00:00:08.188 --> 00:00:09.343
Walk it backwards.

5
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:10.900
The value you want.

6
00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:12.532
The sales that needs.

7
00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:14.358
The proposals each month.

8
00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:15.811
Then each week.

9
00:00:16.269 --> 00:00:17.085
Then each day.

10
00:00:18.006 --> 00:00:21.736
If we do those daily things,
we are in the possibility game.

11
00:00:22.431 --> 00:00:25.506
If we ignore them,
we're in the impossibility game.

12
00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:28.218
I call the daily part showing up.

13
00:00:28.881 --> 00:00:29.916
Visit twenty places.

14
00:00:30.959 --> 00:00:32.381
Send each a presentation.

15
00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:34.072
That's the work you control.

16
00:00:34.816 --> 00:00:36.949
After a while the pipeline
turns into numbers.

17
00:00:37.729 --> 00:00:41.123
A cost to acquire a customer:
your time, your money.

18
00:00:41.752 --> 00:00:44.191
And a formula: how do I lower it?

19
00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:46.853
Write one big goal.

20
00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:49.137
Work backwards to a day.

